infographic sequence-pyramid-simple
data
  title Why dependencies point inward: the stability gradient
  desc Stability rises toward the center; volatility rises toward the edge
  sequences
    - label Entities — most stable core
      desc Enterprise business rules. Change only when the business model itself changes.
    - label Use Cases
      desc Application-specific rules. Change when app behavior changes, not technology.
    - label Interface Adapters
      desc Controllers, presenters, gateways. Change when I/O formats change.
    - label Frameworks & Drivers — most volatile
      desc DB, web, libraries. Change for tech reasons: ORM upgrade, cloud swap, API deprecation.
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #0ea5e9 #f59e0b #f43f5e
